Given a sentence, , print each word of the sentence in a new line.

Input Format

The first and only line contains a sentence, .

Constraints


Output Format

Print each word of the sentence in a new line.

Sample Input 0

This is C 
Sample Output 0

This
is
C




SOLUTION

int main() {

char *s;
s = malloc(1024 * sizeof(char));
scanf("%[^\n]", s);
s = realloc(s, strlen(s) + 1);
for(int i = 0;s[i]!='\0';i++){
    if(s[i] ==' '){
        s[i] = '\n';
    }
}
printf("%s",s);

free(s);
return 0;
}
